inputSchema.description:
Request to download images from a Figma file.

REQUIRED PARAMETERS:
- file_key: The Figma file key (string)
- images: List of image download requests (array of objects)

Example request:
    {
        "file_key": "abc123XYZ",
        "images": [
            {"node_id": "1:2", "file_name": "logo.png", "format": "png"},
            {"node_id": "3:4", "file_name": "icon.svg", "format": "svg"}
        ]
    }

items.description:
Individual image download request specifying which node to render and how to save it.

Example:
    {"node_id": "1:2", "file_name": "logo.png", "format": "png"}
